---
title: Signing Flow (sequence) - OmniSign PAdES signature
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant App as Desktop / CLI
  participant UC as SignDocumentUseCase
  participant Repo as DssSigningRepository
  participant Pwd as PasswordCallback
  participant Tok as PKCS11 token
  participant KS as PKCS12 keystore file
  participant DSS as DSS PAdESService
  participant TSA as Timestamp Authority
  participant Trust as Trusted Lists + OCSP/CRL

  User->>App: sign(document, parameters)
  App->>UC: invoke(SigningParameters)
  UC->>Repo: signDocument(params)
  Repo->>Repo: resolve config (global, profile, operation)
  Repo->>Repo: check signing algorithm not expired
  opt signature level above B
    Repo->>Repo: require timestamp server configured
  end

  Note over Repo,KS: resolve the signing identity (silent pass, then interactive)
  alt keystoreFile supplied (PKCS12)
    Repo->>KS: open keystore
    opt password not supplied non-interactively
      Repo->>Pwd: requestPassword("Enter keystore password")
      Pwd->>User: prompt
      User-->>Pwd: password
      Pwd-->>Repo: password
    end
    KS-->>Repo: private key entry
  else PKCS11 token / HSM
    Repo->>Tok: discover tokens / probe present
    alt token needs PIN and none cached
      Repo->>Pwd: requestPassword("Enter PIN ...")
      Pwd->>User: prompt
      User-->>Pwd: PIN
      Pwd-->>Repo: PIN
    end
    Repo->>Tok: PKCS11 login + load signing key
    Tok-->>Repo: private key entry
  end

  Repo->>Trust: build certificate verifier (load EU LOTL + trusted lists)
  opt level B-T / B-LT / B-LTA
    Repo->>DSS: setTspSource(TSA endpoint)
  end

  Repo->>DSS: getDataToSign(document, params)
  DSS-->>Repo: data to sign (digest)
  alt PKCS11 token / HSM
    Repo->>Tok: sign(dataToSign) on token
    Tok-->>Repo: signature value
  else PKCS12 keystore file
    Repo->>KS: sign(dataToSign) with the loaded key
    KS-->>Repo: signature value
  end
  Repo->>DSS: signDocument(document, params, signatureValue)
  opt level B-T / B-LT / B-LTA
    DSS->>TSA: RFC 3161 timestamp request
    TSA-->>DSS: timestamp token
  end
  opt level B-LT / B-LTA
    DSS->>Trust: fetch OCSP / CRL revocation data
    Trust-->>DSS: revocation responses
  end
  opt level B-LTA
    DSS->>TSA: archive timestamp request
    TSA-->>DSS: archive timestamp token
  end
  DSS-->>Repo: signed PDF
  Repo->>Repo: collect + sanitize DSS warnings
  Repo-->>UC: OperationResult (SigningResult)
  UC-->>App: result (+ warnings)
  App-->>User: signed document
